{
  "$comment": "Wisp 全局设计令牌的唯一事实来源。tokens.css、Pele 映射、图表 lint、Excalidraw/draw.io 素材库全部由此生成，禁止在别处硬编码颜色。",
  "version": 1,
  "color": {
    "base": {
      "bg": { "light": "#fcfcfb", "dark": "#111214" },
      "surface": { "light": "#f4f4f2", "dark": "#18191c" },
      "surface-2": { "light": "#ebebe7", "dark": "#202125" },
      "border": { "light": "#e2e2dd", "dark": "#2b2d31" },
      "fg": { "light": "#1d1d1f", "dark": "#e6e6e3" },
      "muted": { "light": "#5c6067", "dark": "#a0a4ab" },
      "subtle": {
        "light": "#8b9098",
        "dark": "#6b7078",
        "$comment": "仅用于非文本元素（分隔线、图标），对比度不满足正文 AA"
      },
      "accent": { "light": "#0f766e", "dark": "#4fd1c0" },
      "accent-fg": { "light": "#ffffff", "dark": "#0b1f1d" },
      "code-bg": { "light": "#f6f6f4", "dark": "#16171a" },
      "selection": { "light": "#ccf0ea", "dark": "#1d3d39" }
    },
    "hue": {
      "$comment": "8 色分类色板，按「印刷油墨」调：OKLCH 中 light stroke L≈0.37–0.51、C≤0.11，fill 是近纸色的淡洗（L≈0.95、C≈0.02）；dark stroke L≈0.70–0.85、C≤0.10，fill L≈0.26。teal light 与 accent 同色。易混的两两（blue/violet、green/teal、amber/orange、teal/slate）靠明度拉开。stroke 用于线条/文字（对 bg 与自身 fill 都 ≥4.5:1），fill 用于填充底色。顺序即 Pele --pele-series-1..8 的顺序。",
      "blue": {
        "stroke": { "light": "#2f5783", "dark": "#a9cbef" },
        "fill": { "light": "#e9f2fb", "dark": "#1a2634" }
      },
      "amber": {
        "stroke": { "light": "#7b5518", "dark": "#f2c681" },
        "fill": { "light": "#fbf2df", "dark": "#2e2515" }
      },
      "green": {
        "stroke": { "light": "#2c522d", "dark": "#84b585" },
        "fill": { "light": "#e9f5e9", "dark": "#1a281c" }
      },
      "rose": {
        "stroke": { "light": "#984646", "dark": "#eda9aa" },
        "fill": { "light": "#fcedec", "dark": "#341f1f" }
      },
      "violet": {
        "stroke": { "light": "#4d335c", "dark": "#bb9ece" },
        "fill": { "light": "#f5eef9", "dark": "#291e2e" }
      },
      "teal": {
        "stroke": { "light": "#0f766e", "dark": "#7fd3c5" },
        "fill": { "light": "#e3f5f3", "dark": "#112926" }
      },
      "orange": {
        "stroke": { "light": "#762f06", "dark": "#ce8d66" },
        "fill": { "light": "#fceee4", "dark": "#311f15" }
      },
      "slate": {
        "stroke": { "light": "#464e57", "dark": "#9da7b3" },
        "fill": { "light": "#eaedf2", "dark": "#23272b" }
      }
    },
    "semantic": {
      "$comment": "ML/算法讲解的固定语义色，所有文章、图表、交互组件一致使用。值为 hue 名。",
      "q": "blue",
      "k": "amber",
      "v": "green",
      "weight": "violet",
      "activation": "teal",
      "grad": "rose",
      "bias": "orange",
      "mask": "slate",
      "highlight": "amber",
      "visited": "slate",
      "active": "blue",
      "done": "green",
      "error": "rose"
    }
  },
  "font": {
    "sans": [
      "Inter Variable",
      "Noto Sans SC Variable",
      "-apple-system",
      "BlinkMacSystemFont",
      "PingFang SC",
      "HarmonyOS Sans SC",
      "MiSans",
      "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "Microsoft YaHei",
      "sans-serif"
    ],
    "mono": [
      "JetBrains Mono Variable",
      "ui-monospace",
      "SFMono-Regular",
      "Menlo",
      "Consolas",
      "Noto Sans SC Variable",
      "PingFang SC",
      "monospace"
    ],
    "hand": ["Excalifont", "Virgil", "Noto Sans SC Variable", "PingFang SC", "sans-serif"],
    "$comment": "hand 仅用于 Excalidraw 手绘风图表。中文统一回落到 Noto Sans SC，不使用小赖体。"
  },
  "type": {
    "base-px": { "mobile": 16, "desktop": 17 },
    "line-height": { "body": 1.8, "heading": 1.35, "code": 1.65, "ui": 1.5 },
    "scale-rem": {
      "xs": 0.8125,
      "sm": 0.875,
      "base": 1,
      "lg": 1.125,
      "h4": 1.0625,
      "h3": 1.25,
      "h2": 1.5,
      "h1": 2,
      "display": 2.5
    },
    "weight": { "body": 400, "medium": 500, "strong": 600, "heading": 600 },
    "measure-em": 42
  },
  "space": { "unit-px": 4, "scale": [0, 4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64, 96] },
  "radius": { "sm": 4, "md": 8, "lg": 12 },
  "diagram": {
    "stroke-width": { "thin": 1, "normal": 1.25, "bold": 2 },
    "font-size-px": { "label": 14, "title": 18, "note": 12 },
    "grid-px": 8,
    "corner-radius": 4,
    "excalidraw": { "roughness": 1, "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeStyle": "solid" },
    "drawio": { "rounded": 1, "absoluteArcSize": 1, "arcSize": 8, "shadow": 0, "sketch": 0 },
    "$comment": "corner-radius 是渲染出的圆角（px），与页面 box 圆角一致。draw.io 的 absoluteArcSize=1 时 arcSize 是圆角直径，所以 arcSize = 2 × corner-radius；Excalidraw 用 roundness {type: 3, value: corner-radius}。"
  }
}
